DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
/* >Natural Source Header 000000
/* :Mode S
/* :CP
/* <Natural Source Header
*  Object    RMSCPWAP
*  Function  Return Spool Queue Attributes from Field queue-display-rec
*  Version   1.3
*
*  Maintenance
*  uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
*  mrs 93-04-06 s(999999) created
*  mrs 93-04-06 s(217959) user information and spooled-pages added
*  NOM3107 SUPPORT 7 BYTE JOBNUMBRS
*  SJU 05-05-03 UNDO NOM3107 - MUSTMATCHQUEUE-DISPLAY-RECORD
*  ---------------------------------------------------------------------
1 RMSCPWA-PARMS
  2 RMSCPWA-RECORD (A136) /* FHI NOM3107 WAS 136
*  SJU ABOVE BACK TO 136 (WAS 140)
*
  2 RMSCPWA-ATTRIBUTES
*
    3 RMSCPWA-JOB-NAME (A8)
    3 RMSCPWA-JOB-NUMBER (N7)
    3 RMSCPWA-SEGMENT-NUMBER (N3)
*
    3 RMSCPWA-ORIG-JOB-NUMBER (N5)
*
    3 RMSCPWA-RECORD-LENGTH (N3)
    3 RMSCPWA-CC-TYPE (I2)
    3 RMSCPWA-COPIES (N3)
*
    3 RMSCPWA-WRITER (A8)
    3 RMSCPWA-FORM (A8)
    3 RMSCPWA-FLASH (A4)
    3 RMSCPWA-USER-INFORMATION (A16)
    3 RMSCPWA-SPOOLED-PAGES (N10)
END-DEFINE
